{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29929","headline":"七夕诗 · 赵璜","name":"七夕诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乌鹊桥头双扇开，年年一度过河来。\n莫嫌天上稀相见，犹胜人间去不回。\n欲减烟花饶俗世，暂烦云月掩楼台。\n别时旧路长清浅，岂肯离情似死灰。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵璜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29929.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29929","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}